1
00:00:00,502 --> 00:00:02,802
(Leonard:)Hi.
Hey, guys.

2
00:00:02,804 --> 00:00:04,974
(Penny:)Hey.
Hi. There's the little family!

3
00:00:04,973 --> 00:00:07,203
(Sheldon:)Hello.
Hello.

4
00:00:08,643 --> 00:00:10,443
(Leonard:)And their Sherpas.
Mm-hmm.

5
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:13,680
(Howard:)The baby's asleep,
can we put her in your room?

6
00:00:13,682 --> 00:00:15,312
(Penny:)Yeah. Go ahead.
Do you need help?

7
00:00:15,317 --> 00:00:17,187
(Howard:)No. I got it.

8
00:00:17,185 --> 00:00:19,455
(Howard:)Doubtfire, Poppins, follow me.

9
00:00:22,190 --> 00:00:23,620
(Bernadette:)Sorry we're late.

10
00:00:23,625 --> 00:00:25,855
(Penny:)Oh, it's no problem, Amy and
Sheldon were just telling us

11
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,130
(Penny:)about their trip to Texas.

12
00:00:27,128 --> 00:00:28,328
(Sheldon:)Yeah. Here.

13
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:29,500
(Sheldon:)I'll catch you up.

14
00:00:29,497 --> 00:00:31,567
(Sheldon:)How did we get in the car?

15
00:00:31,566 --> 00:00:32,596
(Penny:)Stop.

16
00:00:34,035 --> 00:00:36,635
(Penny:)Okay. They told Mary
they were living together,

17
00:00:36,638 --> 00:00:38,808
(Penny:)there was a fight, he
got his feelings hurt,

18
00:00:38,807 --> 00:00:39,817
(Penny:)then he put underwear
on his head...

19
00:00:39,843 --> 00:00:40,773
(Leonard:)On purpose,

20
00:00:40,775 --> 00:00:43,405
(Leonard:)not the way it used to
happen in high school.

21
00:00:43,411 --> 00:00:47,751
(Sheldon:)I was acting odd
intentionally.

22
00:00:47,749 --> 00:00:50,219
(Bernadette:)Really? So you can control it?

23
00:00:52,787 --> 00:00:54,217
(Penny:)Okay. Then what happened?

24
00:00:54,222 --> 00:00:56,422
(Sheldon:)Well, there's really
not much left to tell.

25
00:00:56,424 --> 00:00:58,994
(Sheldon:)I decided that my mother
views me as a child

